OL,3,GNEWSAPolice unit pulls plug on Palantir
OL,4,AAI technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FA policing unit that tackles serious
OL,7,Fand organised crime has decided not to
OL,8,Fcontinue using software from the
OL,9,Fcontroversial US tech giant Palantir
OL,10,Fafter a two-year trial.
OL,12,FThe firm's technology, which allows
OL,13,Flarge datasets to be analysed and
OL,14,Fsearched easily, including through the
OL,15,Fuse of AI, is being used by militaries
OL,16,Fand public services worldwide.
OL,18,FEast Midlands Special Operations Unit
OL,19,F(EMSOU) said it started a trial in
OL,20,FOctober 2024 to see how well Palantir's
OL,21,Fsoftware could help it investigate
OL,22,Fcrime without compromising ethics.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
