OL,3,GNEWSAPolice unit pulls plug on Palantir
OL,4,AAI technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it has decided not to fund a new
OL,7,Fcontract and told the BBC that Palantir
OL,8,Fwill now have to show it has cut links
OL,9,Fwith the force's systems and deleted
OL,10,Fall of its data.
